    <!-- FAQ section removed 2026-08-12 — content will be reintroduced via CRM-managed data once built. See homepage section order: How We Think → How We Work → Why This Not a Bigger Agency → Pricing Teaser → Why Trust a New Agency → Closing CTA. -->

    <!-- ═══════ CLOSING CTA & CONTACT ═══════ -->
    <section id="contact" class="section-pad bg-[#E2E7E6] text-ink">
      <div class="container-content max-w-2xl">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-3 reveal">Closing CTA</p>
